(1) 43C incremental tests now derive endpoint ids from the SSOT
(_endpoint_id_of) instead of hardcoded legacy literals — the A5a
contract change is documented in-file; 6/6 green.

(2) h2_race.py broad handler registered: REGISTERED_FILES entry in
tests/test_editable_broad_exceptions_gate.py + the rationale entry in
docs/ACCEPTED_EXCEPTIONS_REGISTER.md (B6(b): the fail-closed
verify_target_tls settings read — any settings failure keeps STRICT
TLS, the coverage_gap_report double-gate precedent) + sha256 pin in
frozen_modules.sha256, documented as a SCOPE COMPLETION (not a thaw —
the file was never frozen before) in the undocumented_current
subtraction in tests/test_frozen_module_gate.py.

(3) G-02 direct-I/O inventory regenerated by the NEW official tool
scripts/regen_direct_io_inventory_umdr44.py (same contract as the 43C
tool: refuses removals fail-closed, refuses additions outside the
reviewed set, regen_reason recorded): 1223 -> 1225 records, exactly
the two reviewed dynamic_resolution (getattr) additions — h2_race.py
(B6-b) and state/reducers.py (B2) — zero removals, 873 line-drifted
records. No hand edit of the artifact.

Gates: broad-exceptions + frozen 641 passed; G-02 4 passed.
